Cell["Divergent piece", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"6c22de65-1b63-46a9-9453-d504fc8c8858"],

Cell["\<\
It was easier to implement the FG projection on this term without using the \
amplitude, see below. The fine threshold tuning is not implemented so only \
even dimension works.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a34c57fd-95d5-4aca-9d1b-de5768722584"],

